### 1. Network Status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/network-status


### 2. Prediction
POST http://localhost:8080/network/prediction
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serverId": "server-1",
  "riskScore": 80.5,
  "riskLevel": "HIGH"
}


### 3. Decision
POST http://localhost:8080/network/decision
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "REDISTRIBUTE",
  "fromServer": "server-1",
  "toServer": "server-2",
  "reason": "High risk detected",
  "verified": true
}


### 4. Traffic Redistribute
POST http://localhost:8080/traffic/redistribute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "REDISTRIBUTE",
  "fromServer": "server-1",
  "toServer": "server-2",
  "reason": "High risk detected",
  "verified": true
}


### 5. Check Active Server
GET http://localhost:8080/traffic/active-server